# ToolsBuilt

> Free, fast, private online calculators and productivity utilities that run entirely in your web browser.

ToolsBuilt provides focused, single-purpose calculation and conversion tools with no signups, no paywalls, and no server-side data processing. All user inputs stay 100% private inside the client's browser.

## Core Principles

- **Client-Side Processing**: Every calculation and conversion runs locally in JavaScript. No form inputs or sensitive data are ever sent to a server.
- **Privacy by Design**: No account creation. Calculations run in the browser and inputs are not sent to a server. Anonymous traffic statistics are collected with Google Analytics.
- **Fast & Accessible**: Lightweight vanilla HTML, CSS, and JavaScript with instant feedback, keyboard navigation, and responsive mobile-first layouts.
- **Free Forever**: All tools are completely free to use without restrictions.

